| 1 | 1 | 1→**9** | Largest option; remaining graph supports Eulerian circuit from 9 |
| 2 | 9 | 9→**7** | Only option |
| 3 | 7 | 7→**3** | 7→9 is a dead end (isolates {1,3,7}); 3 is next largest |
| 4 | 3 | 3→**7** | Largest option; valid |
| 5 | 7 | 7→**1** | 7→9 dead end; 1 is only remaining |
| 6 | 1 | 1→**3** | 1→7 disconnects {1,3} from {7,9}; 1→1 gives smaller result; 3 works |
| 7 | 3 | 3→**1** | Only option |
| 8 | 1 | 1→**1** | 1→7 disconnects {1} from {7,9}; self-loop works |
| 9 | 1 | 1→**7** | Only option |
| 10 | 7 | 7→**9** | Only option; done |

**Resulting sequence:** 6, 1, 9, 7, 3, 7, 1, 3, 1, 1, 7, 9

